{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"一、九年，春王正月，〈木巳〉伯來逆叔姬之喪以歸。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"〈木巳〉伯曷為來逆叔姬之喪以歸？內辭也，脅而歸之也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"二、公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、〈木巳〉伯同盟于蒲。公至自會。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"三、二月，伯姬歸于宋。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"四、夏，季孫行父如宋致女。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"未有言致女者，此其言致女何？錄伯姬也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"五、晉人來媵。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"媵不書，此何以書？錄伯姬也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"六、秋七月丙子，齊侯無野卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"七、晉人執鄭伯。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"八、晉欒書帥師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"九、冬十有一月，葬齊頃公。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"十、楚公子嬰齊帥師伐莒。庚申，莒潰。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"十一、楚人入運。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"十二、秦人、白狄伐晉。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"十三、鄭人圍許。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_cdt_141_17","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_141","textTraditional":"十四、城中城。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}